{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>擁有130萬粉絲追蹤的27歲泰國網紅Natpaphat Ounboontan近日低調來到香港街頭朝聖打卡。她以一身極度清涼純白小背心現身鬧市，衣著暗藏極具衝擊力震撼細節，非常蠱惑！</p>\n<h2>泰國女神街頭打卡 狂吸2萬like</h2>\n<p>Natpaphat Ounboontan走到香港街頭拍下一系列充滿質感照片，畫面中她穿上一件緊身白色小背心，完美勾勒出火辣身材曲線。這件上衣兩側採用大膽通窿剪裁設計，隨著她擺出不同甫士，輕易展露出傲人南半球線條，營造出極大視覺衝擊力。帖文一出隨即吸引大量2.4萬人點讚！</p>\n<h2>27歲網紅擅長大膽風格出鏡</h2>\n<p>1999年出生Natpaphat Ounboontan向來以甜美精緻容貌與火辣魔鬼身材見稱，早就成為泰國當地極具知名度人氣模特兒。翻看其社交平台過往帖文，低胸上衣及超短迷你裙絕對是她衣櫃中最常見必備單品，每次亮相總能充分展現出修長纖細雙腿以及誘人事業線。</p>\n<h2>網民激讚呢件衫設計「泰邪惡」</h2>\n<p>不少粉絲留意到衣服剪裁玄機，留言直指「呢件衫設計實在太邪惡」、「完全展現出最強視覺衝擊力」。更有網民表示被這輯充滿氛圍照片吸引，坦言「睇到女神去香港打卡我都想飛過去朝聖」。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179484259117219717_2225760896afb1fdf9a03f.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"photo_5177357001594441046_y.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179484259117219717_2225760896afb1fdf9a03f.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>泰國女神穿上一件緊身白色小背心，完美勾勒出火辣身材曲線。（圖片來源：IG@vv____viewvy）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179484259272533142_1835429476afb1fe1267f8.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"photo_5177357001594441048_y.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179484259272533142_1835429476afb1fe1267f8.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>隨著她擺出不同甫士，輕易展露出傲人南半球線條，營造出極大視覺衝擊力。（圖片來源：IG@vv____viewvy）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179484259360526803_4594126356afb1fe1eb4f6.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"SaveClip.App_893399812_18679325587041248_5035789143804393232_n.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179484259360526803_4594126356afb1fe1eb4f6.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>向來以甜美精緻容貌與火辣魔鬼身材見稱，早就成為泰國當地極具知名度人氣模特兒。（圖片來源：IG@vv____viewvy）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179484259690012586_7983291586afb1fe59949d.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"SaveClip.App_863510567_18674164963041248_2782567477012800632_n.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179484259690012586_7983291586afb1fe59949d.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>笑容甜美！（圖片來源：IG@vv____viewvy）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179484259945187315_2406762636afb1fe7e5060.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"SaveClip.App_499981292_18535373824041248_728514512673333279_n.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179484259945187315_2406762636afb1fe7e5060.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>每次亮相總能充分展現出修長纖細雙腿以及誘人事業線。（圖片來源：IG@vv____viewvy）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17948426036612265_16461817776afb1fec1f773.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"SaveClip.App_900634299_18680000539041248_5230849043687875108_n.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17948426036612265_16461817776afb1fec1f773.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@vv____viewvy）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？<i></i></p>\n<p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/hong-kong-concerts-2025-2402813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港演唱會2025一覽</a></b>，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-16T15:39:52.945260+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":970,"images":6,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-16T15:23:28+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-16T16:14:27.377118+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-16T15:33:21.006748+00:00","content_hash":"208296ed1e957ebe2dc7a166b99c857c09cb92a45069931c0cfdc2e18684c3e9","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}